    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.mp4?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c353542b4dd325ecf5ad7e4b2afcf752.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/7f8b54c0b086d9ec9e58d1cd1ad82d29.webp?t=1753977702\" width=559 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk in the shoes of Detective Hindsight to explore Sin City and its residents. Who knows what anyone\u2019s hiding behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/5b6b6d9597da9eeac936f049ac51bae3.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/5b6b6d9597da9eeac936f049ac51bae3.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c957aeb5ca34dfd2a3b30190ecbb4dbf.webp?t=1753977702\" width=425 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing cases to sink your investigative teeth into. Analyze various scenes in their different stages at your own pace, using logic to unfurl the mysteries within. Highlight, scribble, and drag clues to deduce what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/ffe16eb52f0851322949b18127557e73.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/ffe16eb52f0851322949b18127557e73.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/3ed77c09f7f00de010309f6048c0ea82.webp?t=1753977702\" width=364 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interact with jaded police officers, gambling nuns and most importantly your (unofficial) sleuthing sidekick: Phoebe, who seems to know a little too much about the crimes that happen around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/4f8066c512a7a70fc5374b9ccc64a27b.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/4f8066c512a7a70fc5374b9ccc64a27b.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c5a6942854f967ecff315238e44e84f8.webp?t=1753977702\" width=323 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or at least she thinks so</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/f57a21bb9bde538d08e5e42e5b05ddf3.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/f57a21bb9bde538d08e5e42e5b05ddf3.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/bed5c56ee530485952004d1a7edcc9bb.mp4?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c353542b4dd325ecf5ad7e4b2afcf752.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/7f8b54c0b086d9ec9e58d1cd1ad82d29.webp?t=1753977702\" width=559 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk in the shoes of Detective Hindsight to explore Sin City and its residents. Who knows what anyone\u2019s hiding behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/5b6b6d9597da9eeac936f049ac51bae3.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/5b6b6d9597da9eeac936f049ac51bae3.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c957aeb5ca34dfd2a3b30190ecbb4dbf.webp?t=1753977702\" width=425 height=17 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing cases to sink your investigative teeth into. Analyze various scenes in their different stages at your own pace, using logic to unfurl the mysteries within. Highlight, scribble, and drag clues to deduce what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/ffe16eb52f0851322949b18127557e73.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/ffe16eb52f0851322949b18127557e73.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/3ed77c09f7f00de010309f6048c0ea82.webp?t=1753977702\" width=364 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and interact with jaded police officers, gambling nuns and most importantly your (unofficial) sleuthing sidekick: Phoebe, who seems to know a little too much about the crimes that happen around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/4f8066c512a7a70fc5374b9ccc64a27b.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/4f8066c512a7a70fc5374b9ccc64a27b.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/c5a6942854f967ecff315238e44e84f8.webp?t=1753977702\" width=323 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or at least she thinks so</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/f57a21bb9bde538d08e5e42e5b05ddf3.poster.avif?t=1753977702\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/f57a21bb9bde538d08e5e42e5b05ddf3.webm?t=1753977702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
